CAPSTONE_PROMPT = """You are the claim-audit agent for the autoresearch campaign in this directory,
spawned by the driver at the end of the loop ({reason}) because the campaign's verification preset asks
for the claim audit at level {level}. CLAUDE.md auto-loads; read campaign.md (its Mission and The ONE
